---
import BaseLayout from "@layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="About PHP Teacher" 
  description="About PHP Teacher - a free PHP learning resource with articles, the language manual, Laravel books, magazines and a large Q&A blog, maintained by the Laravel Company ecosystem."
>
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-[85rem] px-4 py-10 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 lg:py-14">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-neutral-800 dark:text-neutral-100 mb-6">About PHP Teacher</h1>

      <div class="prose prose-blog sm:prose-lg dark:prose-invert max-w-none">
        <h2>What PHP Teacher is</h2>
        <p>
          PHP Teacher is a free learning resource for PHP developers at every level. It brings together
          practical articles, the PHP language manual, Laravel books, an archive of PHP magazines, and a
          large Q&amp;A blog that answers everyday questions about PHP, Laravel, errors, configuration and
          common development problems.
        </p>

        <h2>What you will find here</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Articles</strong> - tutorials and opinion pieces on PHP, frameworks, tooling and working as a developer.</li>
          <li><strong>The PHP manual</strong> - the language reference, kept close while you learn.</li>
          <li><strong>Laravel books and magazines</strong> - longer reads on the framework and the community around it.</li>
          <li><strong>The Q&amp;A blog</strong> - thousands of concrete answers to real error messages and development questions, organised by topic and kept up to date as the ecosystem changes.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Who maintains it</h2>
        <p>
          PHP Teacher is part of the <a href="https://laravelcompany.com">Laravel Company</a> ecosystem and is
          curated and maintained by working developers. Content is organised into categories, reviewed for
          accuracy, and updated as PHP and its tooling evolve.
        </p>

        <h2>Get in touch</h2>
        <p>
          Found an error, or have a suggestion for a topic we should cover? Visit our
          <a href="/contact">contact page</a> - we read every message.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
